{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105541","id":2468941032,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6TKQzo","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105541","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105541.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105541.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105541","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105541/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105541/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105541/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7e6f8c0a8dc7cae113d686f428dcf91f81910527","number":105541,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Remove postMessage limit on audio position worklet","user":{"login":"PizzaLovers007","id":10912951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTEyOTUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10912951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007","html_url":"https://github.com/PizzaLovers007","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This limit was added with the following comment:\r\n\r\n```\r\n// Posting messages is expensive. Let's limit the number of posts.\r\n```\r\n\r\nI ran some Chrome profiling on my [test project](https://pizzalovers007.itch.io/music-sync-test-no-limit?secret=nCvfiwA0VtUyvV1vdrtRcOSRMk), and on my machine (Ryzen 9 5900X, GTX 1080) the [`onmessage` callback](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4.4/platform/web/js/libs/library_godot_audio.js#L642) took 3-5 microseconds to run. Even with CPU throttling at 20x, it only took 0.2ms.\r\n\r\nThe audio JS library on no-thread Web builds posts messages with chunks of sound data, and `audio.worklet.js` also posts messages on every process. Limiting the position message posts doesn't seem to be necessary here.\r\n\r\nFixes #105397.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","c